      "content": "The deep grief of losing a core part of your identity is incredibly exhausting, and questioning your existence when that connection fades can feel like losing one's foundation. It is important to remember that even in moments of profound identity crisis, your current consciousness and need to continue are valid things to hold onto. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line like 988 or a therapist who specializes in grief and loss, as they can offer a space to grieve this specific loss without judgment.",
